<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL"
                  xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI"
                  xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC"
                  xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI"
                  xmlns:bootstrap.processes="https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap/v0/processes/ns/"
                  xmlns:cat-harness.processes="https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/v0/processes/ns/"
                  id="Definitions_Process_StalledAgentTriage" targetNamespace="https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/workflows"
                  exporter="folio-assistant" exporterVersion="1">
  <bpmn:import namespace="https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap/v0/processes/ns/" location="https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap/v0/processes/ns.jsonld" importType="http://www.w3.org/ns/json-ld"/>
  <bpmn:resource id="authoring-agent" name="Authoring agent"/>
  <bpmn:resource id="session-coordinator" name="Session coordinator"/>
  <bpmn:resource id="user" name="User"/>
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collaboration_Process_StalledAgentTriage">
    <bpmn:participant id="Participant_Process_StalledAgentTriage" name="Stalled-agent triage &amp; bidirectional relay re-entry: audit deltas, salvage worktrees, consolidate, re-route" processRef="Process_StalledAgentTriage"/>
  </bpmn:collaboration>
  <bpmn:process id="Process_StalledAgentTriage" name="Stalled-agent triage &amp; bidirectional relay re-entry" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation>When agents stall (quota exhausted, context full, container lost, session timed out) OR when an agent returns on its next turn after another session advanced the repository, execute Bidirectional Relay Continuity: reconcile remote commits and epic write-ahead snapshots, classify open and draft PRs, inspect worktrees, /tmp overlays, and Cargo/Lean donor caches non-destructively (never git reset --hard; rescue dirty unpushed work onto claude/salvage-* or resume in place), consolidate workstreams into 2-4 themes when owner triage is needed, reconcile the epic lease table on cat/cat-harness/beans, and re-route ready PRs through the Merge Steward. Operating skills: stalled-agent-triage, handover-report, prepare-for-handover, agent-handoff, bean-coordination, coordinate, merge-manager-watcher.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:extensionElements>
      <cat-harness.processes:policy enforcement="strict"/>
    </bpmn:extensionElements>
    <bpmn:laneSet id="LaneSet_Process_StalledAgentTriage">
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_Triage" name="Triage / re-entering agent" partitionElementRef="authoring-agent">
        <bpmn:documentation>Audits remote default-branch and beans deltas, reads the epic write-ahead Live Relay Snapshot, classifies open and draft PRs, inspects worktrees, /tmp overlays, and Cargo/Lean donor caches non-destructively (rescuing dirty stalled work onto claude/salvage-* rather than resetting), consolidates themes, and reconciles the epic lease table.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Start_SAT</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>A_Footprint</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>A_Collect</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>A_Consolidate</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>A_Record</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_SAT</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_Steward" name="Merge steward" partitionElementRef="session-coordinator">
        <bpmn:documentation>Receives classified open PRs: queues verified green ready-to-merge PRs, leaves active external sibling drafts untouched, re-drives mid-merge or stalled branches from their PR head or salvage branch, and holds owner-fenced PRs.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>S_Reroute</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_User" name="User" partitionElementRef="user">
        <bpmn:documentation>Decides one theme at a time (continue, fold into the plan, new epic, park, or scrap), or supplies standing grant/plan continuity when returning on a turn without scope ambiguity.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>U_Decide</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_SAT" name="Agents stalled, owner asks to pick up work, or agent re-enters"/>
    <bpmn:task id="A_Footprint" name="Audit remote delta, epic relay snapshot &amp; PR classes">
      <bpmn:documentation>Steps 1-3 of re-entry reconciliation: fetch origin/&lt;default-branch&gt; and origin/cat/cat-harness/beans, audit git log &lt;last-known-sha&gt;..origin/&lt;default-branch&gt;, read the epic bean's write-ahead Live Relay Snapshot (child beans, active research/compute hypotheses, negative/excluded routes, lease table), and classify open and draft PRs into ready-to-merge, active external sibling draft, stalled with uncommitted/unpushed work, and owner-fenced.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <bootstrap.processes:skill ref="stalled-agent-triage"/>
        <bootstrap.processes:skill ref="agent-handoff"/>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="A_Collect" name="Inspect worktrees non-destructively, salvage &amp; collect handovers">
      <bpmn:documentation>Step 4 of re-entry reconciliation: inspect every local worktree (git status --short --branch, ahead/behind origin), /tmp overlays, and Cargo/Lean donor caches without ever running git reset --hard; rescue dirty or unpushed stalled work onto a claude/salvage-* branch (and push it) or resume in place, and verify or reconstruct handover reports. Unpushed remote state is unknown, never empty.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <bootstrap.processes:skill ref="stalled-agent-triage"/>
        <bootstrap.processes:skill ref="handover-report"/>
        <bootstrap.processes:skill ref="prepare-for-handover"/>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="A_Consolidate" name="Consolidate into 2-4 themes, with a recommendation each">
      <bpmn:documentation>Group by what the work delivers, not by agent. Each theme gets its epic, members, dependencies, risk, and one of: continue, fold in, new epic, park, scrap (owner only).</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements><bootstrap.processes:skill ref="stalled-agent-triage"/></bpmn:extensionElements>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:callActivity id="U_Decide" calledElement="Process_AskThePerson" name="Decide each theme">
      <bpmn:extensionElements><cat-harness.processes:no-skill reason="The user's decision. The triage agent presents each theme with context, options and a recommendation, one decision in full and a count of the rest."/></bpmn:extensionElements>
    </bpmn:callActivity>
    <bpmn:task id="A_Record" name="Reconcile epic lease table, write-ahead checkpoint &amp; sibling notes">
      <bpmn:documentation>Step 5 of re-entry reconciliation: update and push the epic bean's write-ahead Worktree/Branch/Scratch Lease Table, child beans, and active/excluded hypotheses on cat/cat-harness/beans; record a 'triage: &lt;date&gt;' note, claim picked-up work via beans:claim, and post sibling coordination notes if landed commits shifted scope.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <bootstrap.processes:skill ref="bean-coordination"/>
        <bootstrap.processes:skill ref="agent-handoff"/>
        <bootstrap.processes:skill ref="coordinate"/>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="S_Reroute" name="Re-route ready PRs &amp; resume Merge Steward + worker queues">
      <bpmn:documentation>Green ready-to-merge PRs join the Merge Steward queue; active external sibling drafts stay untouched; mid-merge or salvaged stalled branches are re-driven cleanly from their PR or salvage head; owner-fenced PRs hold.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <bootstrap.processes:skill ref="coordinate"/>
        <bootstrap.processes:skill ref="merge-manager-watcher"/>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_SAT" name="Relay reconciled; queues and epic lease table live"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_Process_StalledAgentTriage_1" sourceRef="Start_SAT" targetRef="A_Footprint"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_Process_StalledAgentTriage_2" sourceRef="A_Footprint" targetRef="A_Collect"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_Process_StalledAgentTriage_3" sourceRef="A_Collect" targetRef="A_Consolidate"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_Process_StalledAgentTriage_4" sourceRef="A_Consolidate" targetRef="U_Decide"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_Process_StalledAgentTriage_5" sourceRef="U_Decide" targetRef="A_Record"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_Process_StalledAgentTriage_6" sourceRef="A_Record" targetRef="S_Reroute"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_Process_StalledAgentTriage_7" sourceRef="S_Reroute" targetRef="End_SAT"/>
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="Diagram_Process_StalledAgentTriage">
    <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="Plane_Process_StalledAgentTriage" bpmnElement="Collaboration_Process_StalledAgentTriage">
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_Participant_Process_StalledAgentTriage" bpmnElement="Participant_Process_StalledAgentTriage" isHorizontal="true">
        <dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="1320" height="510" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_Lane_Triage" bpmnElement="Lane_Triage" isHorizontal="true">
        <dc:Bounds x="190" y="250" width="1290" height="170" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_Lane_Steward" bpmnElement="Lane_Steward" isHorizontal="true">
        <dc:Bounds x="190" y="80" width="1290" height="170" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_Lane_User" bpmnElement="Lane_User" isHorizontal="true">
        <dc:Bounds x="190" y="420" width="1290" height="170" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_Start_SAT" bpmnElement="Start_SAT">
        <dc:Bounds x="274" y="317" width="36" height="36" />
        
      <bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="224" y="357" width="136" height="54" /></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_A_Footprint" bpmnElement="A_Footprint">
        <dc:Bounds x="370" y="275" width="120" height="120" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_A_Collect" bpmnElement="A_Collect">
        <dc:Bounds x="530" y="275" width="120" height="120" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_A_Consolidate" bpmnElement="A_Consolidate">
        <dc:Bounds x="690" y="275" width="120" height="120" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_U_Decide" bpmnElement="U_Decide">
        <dc:Bounds x="850" y="445" width="120" height="120" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_A_Record" bpmnElement="A_Record">
        <dc:Bounds x="1010" y="275" width="120" height="120" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_S_Reroute" bpmnElement="S_Reroute">
        <dc:Bounds x="1170" y="105" width="120" height="120" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_End_SAT" bpmnElement="End_SAT">
        <dc:Bounds x="1330" y="317" width="36" height="36" />
        
      <bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="1370" y="290" width="90" height="90" /></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Edge_SF_Process_StalledAgentTriage_1" bpmnElement="SF_Process_StalledAgentTriage_1">
        <di:waypoint x="310" y="335" />
        <di:waypoint x="370" y="335" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Edge_SF_Process_StalledAgentTriage_2" bpmnElement="SF_Process_StalledAgentTriage_2">
        <di:waypoint x="490" y="335" />
        <di:waypoint x="530" y="335" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Edge_SF_Process_StalledAgentTriage_3" bpmnElement="SF_Process_StalledAgentTriage_3">
        <di:waypoint x="650" y="335" />
        <di:waypoint x="690" y="335" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Edge_SF_Process_StalledAgentTriage_4" bpmnElement="SF_Process_StalledAgentTriage_4">
        <di:waypoint x="810" y="335" />
        <di:waypoint x="830" y="335" />
        <di:waypoint x="830" y="505" />
        <di:waypoint x="850" y="505" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Edge_SF_Process_StalledAgentTriage_5" bpmnElement="SF_Process_StalledAgentTriage_5">
        <di:waypoint x="970" y="505" />
        <di:waypoint x="990" y="505" />
        <di:waypoint x="990" y="335" />
        <di:waypoint x="1010" y="335" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Edge_SF_Process_StalledAgentTriage_6" bpmnElement="SF_Process_StalledAgentTriage_6">
        <di:waypoint x="1130" y="335" />
        <di:waypoint x="1150" y="335" />
        <di:waypoint x="1150" y="165" />
        <di:waypoint x="1170" y="165" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Edge_SF_Process_StalledAgentTriage_7" bpmnElement="SF_Process_StalledAgentTriage_7">
        <di:waypoint x="1290" y="165" />
        <di:waypoint x="1310" y="165" />
        <di:waypoint x="1310" y="335" />
        <di:waypoint x="1330" y="335" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
    </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
  </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
</bpmn:definitions>
